                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ada051f7-250b-359c-86ac-8dad974b25f4",
                        "entry_id": "9548384a-04fe-3944-a98e-c7b41525cb91",
                        "glosses": [
                            "тот, кто занимается рубкой чего-либо, рубит что-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cae97e9f-5596-485e-9f3a-f2222747377f",
                                "sense_id": "ada051f7-250b-359c-86ac-8dad974b25f4",
                                "text": "Песня становилась ещё сильнее и ещё шире и выше, – казалось, её подхватили рубщики в красных рубахах, видневшиеся в лесном ущелье, которое вздымалось зелёной стеной от стапеля к небу."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3495245a-76ba-4df2-a5ad-432a5d4a73cf",
                        "source_entry_id": "9548384a-04fe-3944-a98e-c7b41525cb91",
                        "source_sense_id": "ada051f7-250b-359c-86ac-8dad974b25f4",
                        "target_lang_word": "hewer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hewer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "472f6c36-fe5d-3e8d-b114-a94d76471ee1",
                                        "entry_id": "067e7394-ba92-359e-8898-94e438aa40e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who hews."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b4cf372-ab62-4e12-86b5-8d8e33e32d41",
                                                "sense_id": "472f6c36-fe5d-3e8d-b114-a94d76471ee1",
                                                "text": "And behold, I will giue to thy seruants the hewers that cut timber, twentie thousand measures of beaten wheat, and twentie thousand measures of barley, and twentie thousand baths of wine, and twentie thousand baths of oyle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b49a707-e9fc-438b-bb5a-38c7e1cfea2a",
                                                "sense_id": "472f6c36-fe5d-3e8d-b114-a94d76471ee1",
                                                "text": "The Larrakiahs at Port Darwin seem to have identified themselves with the white population, and became hewers of wood and drawers of water for the settlement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0064fb8f-9409-40e7-91d2-c26be2a26576",
                                                "sense_id": "472f6c36-fe5d-3e8d-b114-a94d76471ee1",
                                                "text": "By certain arrangements in the former method the miner not only gets the coal but makes all proppings and repairs, so that the face moves much more slowly than with the other method where the hewers devote all their time to getting the coal […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ecc9daf-8fba-45d8-a380-80b78bbbe66d",
                                                "sense_id": "472f6c36-fe5d-3e8d-b114-a94d76471ee1",
                                                "text": "But what of that vast number of the human kind who were always in the background? What of the hewers of wood and drawers of water, the swineherds, the shepherds, the carpenters, the hedgers and cobblers?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abf6defc-6f2a-42de-832c-4e48831f4705",
                                                "sense_id": "472f6c36-fe5d-3e8d-b114-a94d76471ee1",
                                                "text": "All three groups were paid less per shift than coal miners. In 1905, for instance, hewers in coal mines received an average 3.79 marks per shift; in zinc and lead, 3.10 marks; in iron, 2.36 marks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "34ed1cd2-ca6e-44bb-87d9-f9e795e1abc0",
                        "source_entry_id": "9548384a-04fe-3944-a98e-c7b41525cb91",
                        "source_sense_id": "ada051f7-250b-359c-86ac-8dad974b25f4",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hauer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hauer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2040377-e2f6-3af1-bfc1-5688addc1ffc",
                                        "entry_id": "d4acf4d4-c185-3747-8ad4-ccbfabc9297b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plural 3 Bergmann, Arbeiter im Bergbau, der Bodenschätze und Gestein aus dem Berg löst"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Bergbau",
                                            "Beruf"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d530df49-fb41-4f7d-be3b-8b1b82817886",
                                                "sense_id": "c2040377-e2f6-3af1-bfc1-5688addc1ffc",
                                                "text": "Hauer sind Bergleute."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb25a10f-0633-4d7e-b6f7-67aaa63b0910",
                                                "sense_id": "c2040377-e2f6-3af1-bfc1-5688addc1ffc",
                                                "text": "„Schröder, der auf der Schachtanlage Walsum zunächst Hauer lernte, erwarb zwar viele Sachbücher und Werke namhafter Dichter, Schriftsteller oder Großdenker; aber mindestens ebenso viel Geld gab er für Trivialliteratur aus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0661d3fe-f2d7-440e-b5eb-aae05d323d1f",
                                                "sense_id": "c2040377-e2f6-3af1-bfc1-5688addc1ffc",
                                                "text": "„Mehrere Jahre arbeitete er in Bottrop und Elberfeld als Hauer und Steiger.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72aab270-c191-41fb-ba3a-b7491c753edd",
                                                "sense_id": "c2040377-e2f6-3af1-bfc1-5688addc1ffc",
                                                "text": "„Wenn der Hauer die Erzbrocken aus dem Stollen geklopft hat, sind sie noch lange nicht aus dem Berg.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82827c3b-3ef9-350c-9b73-9f85ac31ee2b",
                                        "entry_id": "d4acf4d4-c185-3747-8ad4-ccbfabc9297b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die hervorstehenden Eckzähne eines Keilers"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Jägersprache"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdaa453a-2a5d-4faf-825c-2b2c3e7aed1a",
                                                "sense_id": "82827c3b-3ef9-350c-9b73-9f85ac31ee2b",
                                                "text": "Manche Tiere haben mächtige Hauer."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60ff0f4b-0263-3080-a85f-dd7305ee8804",
                                        "entry_id": "d4acf4d4-c185-3747-8ad4-ccbfabc9297b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "der Weinbauer, der Winzer"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Austrian German"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4d2531c-9c60-422f-99ad-06a33ebff032",
                                                "sense_id": "60ff0f4b-0263-3080-a85f-dd7305ee8804",
                                                "text": "Die Hauer des Ortes freuten sich alle über den tollen Jahrgang."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e0ca9132-afb8-423f-b866-9f93aa589483",
                        "source_entry_id": "9548384a-04fe-3944-a98e-c7b41525cb91",
                        "source_sense_id": "ada051f7-250b-359c-86ac-8dad974b25f4",
                        "target_lang_word": "coupeur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coupeur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df867d44-37d0-3213-96f5-1d70e5c16bcc",
                                        "entry_id": "badbc468-f531-39ab-9c8d-88b9ed75eb18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui coupe. — Se dit spécialement de ceux qui coupent les grappes en vendange."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28ebf379-a406-448f-a99f-67d41b5ef937",
                                                "sense_id": "df867d44-37d0-3213-96f5-1d70e5c16bcc",
                                                "text": "Laboureurs des Crêtes ou du Vallage, sarteurs d’Ardenne, coupeurs de foin des censes de Thiérache, tous disposaient de mille et une façons de prédire le temps, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1724513b-d135-44ff-9110-8b764b9518e5",
                                                "sense_id": "df867d44-37d0-3213-96f5-1d70e5c16bcc",
                                                "text": "En effet après avoir utilisé la main-d’œuvre villageoise avant la guerre, espagnole après, étudiante plus récemment, le viticulteur ne sait plus où trouver ses coupeurs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d60a2558-6c30-4f45-873a-7b4a7d97ca8d",
                                                "sense_id": "df867d44-37d0-3213-96f5-1d70e5c16bcc",
                                                "text": "Coupeur de bourses, filou qui dérobe avec adresse l’argent et les autres choses qu’on peut avoir sur soi."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce225004-c6c2-3e52-82bf-da0ae31d2d9d",
                                        "entry_id": "badbc468-f531-39ab-9c8d-88b9ed75eb18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tailleur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3468337b-67a9-4d41-86e6-25a9808b6800",
                                                "sense_id": "ce225004-c6c2-3e52-82bf-da0ae31d2d9d",
                                                "text": "Il était coupeur dans cet atelier de confection."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
